The MIT License above covers the source code and the programs.

No game file is included in this project (only a screenshot of the patcher's
own window, in docs/images): the patcher modifies the user's own Zeus.exe, on
the user's computer. Zeus: Master of Olympus / Poseidon are games by Impressions
Games / Sierra.

Parts of src/ZeusPak.cs (used by the saved game tools, not by the patcher) are
adapted from zeus_mapper by zawapl (MIT License), see LICENSE-zeus_mapper.txt.
